{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yaoci-e-o036","title":"骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤孙权，权欲杀之，由刘基谏争，翻以得免","accounts":[{"id":"yaoci-a-3813f5782766e95bf3d0","label":"正文","text":"骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤孙权，权欲杀之，由刘基谏争，翻以得免","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"id":"yululu-a-b60c2a1329fee62c7b0a","label":"正文","text":"吴王欢宴行酒，虞翻佯醉不持，权大怒手剑欲击之","evidence":["yululu-q-4df3fb5fbebe4d1f5254"]},{"id":"yululu-a-0fbf21ea84f1dedb3398","label":"正文","text":"刘基起抱权谏止杀虞翻，翻由是得免","evidence":["yululu-q-ea07f8f48a2052df32b2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"怒而欲杀者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"醉而犯忤被谏救者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},{"person":"yaoci-p0002","role":"谏争者","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0"]},"ordering_evidence":"yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0","source_order":[49,49,0],"order":8955}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"yaoci-p0002","name":"刘基","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0058","name":"虞翻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yaoci-q-adc0ce4b3172798952a0","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-3f06c5f2959364ec2790","layer":"original","quote":"权尝宴饮，骑都尉虞翻醉酒犯忤〖26〗；权欲杀之，威怒甚盛：由基谏争，翻以得免","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":48,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-4df3fb5fbebe4d1f5254","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-807acbba5821deec1897","layer":"original","quote":"权既为吴王，欢宴之末，自起行酒。翻伏地佯醉，不持〖1〗；权去，翻起坐。权于是大怒，手剑欲击之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ea07f8f48a2052df32b2","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-807acbba5821deec1897","layer":"original","quote":"惟大司农刘基起抱权谏曰〖3〗：“大王以三爵之后手杀善士〖4〗，虽翻有罪，天下孰知之？且大王以能容贤蓄众，故海内望风；今一朝弃之，可乎？”权曰：“曹孟德尚杀孔文举〖5〗，孤于虞翻何有哉！”基曰：“孟德轻害士人，天下非之。大王躬行德义，欲与尧、舜比隆〖6〗：何得自喻于彼乎？”翻由是得免","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":58,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
